      "description": "smartDr is the latest and greatest app made for doctors by doctors.\n\nWhether it be that red NEWS call, dodgy potassium level or a confused patient, smartDr is by your side.\n\nThe app is split into 6 simple sections:\n\n• EMERGENCIES: quick, easy-to-follow algorithms for managing the sickest patients\n\n• NEWS CALLS: address and manage every deranged vital sign \n\n• ASKED TO SEE PATIENT: diagnose and treat a wide range of symptoms \n\n• WARD JOBS: master the basics from prescribing fluids to confirming death \n\n• LAB RESULTS: interpret and correct blood result abnormalities\n\n• CALCULATORS: interactive scoring systems including AMTS, Wells score and CURB-65\n\nAnd this is only the beginning. smartDr will be updated regularly with new content. Feel free to drop us a suggestion at info@smartdr.app\n\nSo what are you waiting for? Become a smartDr today!",
